<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 428 ALL OUT IN SECOND TEST V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 428 ALL OUT IN SECOND TEST V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were all out for 428 in their first innings on the second day of the second test against India at Eden Gardens on Thursday.</p>
</text>
